8
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:42,040
Mr. and Mrs. Zuckerman were in bed by 9.

9
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:51,719
Mrs. Zuckerman lay dreaming about a deep freeze unit. Mr. Zuckerman lay dreaming about Wilbur.

10
00:00:51,719 --> 00:00:59,639
He dreamt that Wilbur had grown until he was 116 ft long and 92 feet high, and

11
00:00:59,639 --> 00:01:04,439
