Every creature planned to get up early to see Wilbur off on his great

16
00:01:23,478 --> 00:01:30,439
adventure. When morning came, everybody got up at daylight. The day was hot. Up

17
00:01:30,439 --> 00:01:35,159
the road at the Arable's house, Fern lugged a pale of hot water to her room

18
00:01:35,159 --> 00:01:38,439
and took a sponge bath.

19
00:01:38,439 --> 00:01:43,239
Then she put on her prettiest dress because she knew she would see boys at

20
00:01:43,239 --> 00:01:49,239
the fair. Mrs. Arable scrubbed the back of Avery's neck and wet his hair and

21
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:55,079
parted it and brushed it down hard till it stuck to the top of his head. All but

22
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:58,840
about six hairs that stood straight up.

23
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:05,159
Avery put on clean underwear, clean blue jeans, and a clean shirt.

24
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:10,120
Mr. wearable dressed, ate breakfast, and then went out and polished his truck. He

25
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:15,000
had offered to drive everybody to the fair, including Wilbur.

26
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:20,200
Bright and early, Lurvy put clean straw in Wilbur's crate and lifted it into the

27
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:32,280
pig pin. The crate was green. In gold letters, it said, "Zuckerman's famous pig."

28
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:38,040
Charlotte had her web looking fine for the occasion. Will ber ate his breakfast

29
00:02:38,040 --> 00:02:44,359
slowly. He tried to look radiant without getting food in his ears.

30
00:02:44,359 --> 00:02:49,799
In the kitchen, Mrs. Zuckerman suddenly made an announcement. Homer, she said to

31
00:02:49,799 --> 00:02:55,799
her husband, I am going to give that pig a buttermilk bath.

32
00:02:55,799 --> 00:03:02,439
What? said Mr. Zuckerman. A buttermilk bath. My grandmother used to bathe her

33
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:07,799
pig with buttermilk when it got dirty. I just remembered.

34
00:03:07,799 --> 00:03:12,760
Wilbur's not dirty, said Mr. Zuckerman proudly.

35
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:15,799
He's filthy behind the ears, said Mrs.

36
00:03:15,799 --> 00:03:22,280
Zuckerman. Every time Lurvy slops him, the food runs down around the ears. Then

37
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:27,879
it dries and forms a crust. He also has a smudge on one side where he lays in

38
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:29,559
