39
00:03:29,559 --> 00:03:33,959
He lays in clean straw, corrected Mr.

40
00:03:33,959 --> 00:03:35,478
Zuckerman.

41
00:03:35,478 --> 00:03:42,520
Well, he's dirty and he's going to have a bath. Mr. Zuckerman sat down weakly

42
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:45,719
