117
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:52,760
Templeton poked his head up through the straw. Struggle if you must, he said.

118
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:58,600
But kindly remember that I'm hiding down here in this crate and I don't want to

119
00:10:58,600 --> 00:11:05,478
be stepped on or kicked in the face or pummeled or crushed in any way or

120
00:11:05,478 --> 00:11:13,079
squashed or buffeted about or bruised or lacerated or scarred or biffed.

121
00:11:13,079 --> 00:11:15,000
Just watch what you're doing, Mr.

122
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:19,639
Radiant, when they get shoving you in.

123
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:22,760
Be quiet, Templeton, said the sheep.

124
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:30,200
Pull in your head. They're coming. Look, Ray and Wilbur. Lay low, Charlotte. Talk

125
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:36,120
it up, geese. The truck back slowly to the pig pin, and stopped. Mr. Arable cut

126
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:44,920
the motor, got out, walked around to the rear, and lowered the tailgate. The geese cheered.

127
00:11:44,920 --> 00:11:49,879
Mrs. Arable got out of the truck. Fern and Avery jumped to the ground. Mrs.

128
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:54,279
