129
00:11:54,279 --> 00:11:59,239
Everybody lined up at the fence and stood for a moment, admiring Wilbur and

130
00:11:59,239 --> 00:12:08,040
the beautiful green crate. Nobody realized that the crate already contained a rat and a spider.

131
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:11,639
"That's some pig," said Mrs. Arable.

132
00:12:11,639 --> 00:12:19,318
"He's terrific," said Lurvy. He's very radiant, said Fern, remembering the day

133
00:12:19,318 --> 00:12:28,840
he was born. Well, said Mrs. Zuckerman, he's clean anyway. The buttermilk certainly helped.

