00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:31,879
Mr. Arable studied Wilbur carefully.

135
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:37,879
Yes, he's a wonderful pig, he said. It's hard to believe that he was the runt of

136
00:12:37,879 --> 00:12:42,840
the litter. You'll get some extra good ham and bacon, Homer, when it comes time

137
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:45,079
