138
00:12:45,079 --> 00:12:51,478
Wilbur heard these words and his heart almost stopped. "I think I'm going to

139
00:12:51,478 --> 00:12:56,920
faint," he whispered to the old sheep who was watching.

140
00:12:56,920 --> 00:13:00,279
"Nelle down," whispered the old sheep.

