142
00:13:03,639 --> 00:13:11,639
Wilbur sank to his knees, all radiance gone. His eyes closed. "Look!" screamed

143
00:13:11,639 --> 00:13:18,760
Fern. He's fading away. Hey, watch me, yelled Avery, crawling on all fours into

144
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:26,040
