147
00:13:36,359 --> 00:13:41,079
The geese saw Avery in the crate and cheered.

148
00:13:41,079 --> 00:13:46,439
Avery, you get out of that crate this instant, commanded his mother. What do

149
00:13:46,439 --> 00:13:55,079
you think you are? I'm a pig, cried Avery, tossing handfuls of straw into the air.

150
00:13:55,079 --> 00:14:00,600
The truck is rolling away, Papa said Fern. The truck, with no one at the

151
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:05,159
wheel, had started to roll downhill.

152
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:09,879
Mr. Arable dashed to the driver's seat and pulled on the emergency brake. The

153
00:14:09,879 --> 00:14:14,760
truck stopped. The geese cheered.

154
00:14:14,760 --> 00:14:19,639
Charlotte crouched and made herself as small as possible in the knot hole so

155
00:14:19,639 --> 00:14:26,279
Avery wouldn't see her. "Come out at once!" cried Mrs. Herble. Avery crawled

156
