out of the crate on hands and knees, making faces at Wilbur. Wilbur fainted away.

157
00:14:33,879 --> 00:14:37,000
"The pig has passed out," said Mrs.

158
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:46,000
Zuckerman. Throw water on him. Throw buttermilk, suggested Avery. The geese cheered.

159
00:14:46,040 --> 00:14:51,478
Lurvy ran for a pale of water. Fern climbed into the pin and knelt by

160
00:14:51,478 --> 00:14:58,600
Wilbur's side. It's Sunstroke, said Zuckerman. The heat is too much for him.

161
00:14:58,600 --> 00:15:02,920
Maybe he's dead, said Avery.

162
00:15:02,920 --> 00:15:09,639
Come out of that pig pin immediately," cried Mrs. Arable. Avery obeyed his

163
00:15:09,639 --> 00:15:13,879
mother and climbed into the back of the truck so he could see better. Lurvy

164
00:15:13,879 --> 00:15:18,279
