165
00:15:18,279 --> 00:15:24,840
"Throw some on me!" cried Avery. "I'm hot, too." "Oh, keep quiet!" hollered

166
00:15:24,840 --> 00:15:31,079
Fern. "Keep quiet!" Her eyes were brimming with tears. Wilbur, feeling the

167
00:15:31,079 --> 00:15:39,000
cold water, came too. He rose slowly to his feet while the geese cheered.

168
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:45,000
"He's up," said Mr. Arable. "I guess there's nothing wrong with him." "I'm

169
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:49,799
hungry," said Avery. "I want a candied apple."

170
00:15:49,799 --> 00:15:55,318
"Wilbur's all right now," said Fern. "We can start. I want to take a ride in the

171
00:15:55,318 --> 00:15:58,359
ferris wheel." Mr. Zuckerman and Mr.

172
00:15:58,359 --> 00:16:03,879
Ariel and Lervy grabbed the pig and pushed him headfirst toward the crate.

173
00:16:03,879 --> 00:16:10,279
Wilbur began to struggle. The harder the men pushed, the harder he held back.

174
