175
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:19,079
Wilbur kicked and thrashed and grunted.

176
00:16:19,079 --> 00:16:21,799
"Nothing wrong with this pig," said Mr.

177
00:16:21,799 --> 00:16:29,959
Zuckerman cheerfully, pressing his knees against Wilbur's behind. All together now, boys. Shove.

178
00:16:29,959 --> 00:16:38,478
With a final heave, they jammed him into the crate. The geese cheered.

179
