181
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:56,279
They did not know that under the straw was a rat and inside a knot hole was a

182
00:16:56,279 --> 00:17:01,478
big gray spider. They saw only a pig.

183
00:17:01,478 --> 00:17:07,398
"Everybody in," called Mr. Arable. He started the motor. The ladies climbed in

184
00:17:07,398 --> 00:17:13,159
beside him. Mr. Zuckerman and Lurvy and Fern and Avery rode in back, hanging on

185
00:17:13,159 --> 00:17:20,600
to the sideboards. The truck began to move ahead. The geese cheered.

186
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:23,000
The children answered their cheer.

187
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:29,510
Woohoo! Woohoo! And away went everybody to the fair.

188
00:17:29,510 --> 00:17:30,000
[Music]
